	(footprint "LearningFPGA:Winbond_WLCSP-21_P0.5mm"
		(layer "B.Cu")
		(uuid "1840ff7e-6a1e-4e95-a9bb-f28254b84289")
		(at 117.75 104.5 -90)
		(descr "Winbond W25Q128JWYIQ 21-ball WLCSP, package code Y, ball pitch 0.5 mm, ball array 2.5 x 2.5 mm (6x6 grid, 21 balls), ball b 0.24/0.30/0.36 mm. Ball map from W25Q128JW Rev.H (17 Apr 2023) Figure 1e p8 (top view, A1 top left) and outline table 10.7 p73. Signal balls use the existing symbol pin numbers: B3=8 VCC, B4=1 /CS, C3=7 /HOLD(IO3), C4=2 DO(IO1), D3=6 CLK, D4=3 /WP(IO2), E3=5 DI(IO0), E4=4 GND; the 13 NC balls keep their ball names and no net. Land 0.25 mm NSMD copper with 0.35 mm mask opening is a Claude choice (about 83% of the nominal ball), not a Winbond land pattern. Body outline D/E is not published (Winbond: contact for details); the 3.0 x 3.0 mm body and 3.5 x 3.5 mm courtyard are assumptions. The 0.5 mm pitch needs filled, capped via-in-pad for the inner signal balls: confirm with JLC. Special-order package per Winbond ordering notes.")
